page.mjs
    Ours: opens /desktop/{name}/ws, hands the socket to noVNC's RFB, and shows what the VNC server
    asks for (a password, or a user name and password).

The server only relays bytes for noVNC (data::desktop::relay), so nothing on the server side has to
match its version. After updating it, run the vnc_desktops e2e test and a real VNC server through
the page.
